{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.braidTrace_eq_kz_of_intertwiner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.braidTrace_eq_kz_of_intertwiner","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L179-L191","doc":"**The KZ-side mass identity as a corollary of the intertwiner**: same statement as\n`KohnoWeighted.braidTrace_eq_kz`, obtained from conjugation by the weight-preserving `U` of\n`kz_jimbo_intertwiner` rather than from per-weight-space trace equalities. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.siteWeight_trace_kz_eq_jimbo_of_intertwiner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.siteWeight_trace_kz_eq_jimbo_of_intertwiner","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L169-L176","doc":"The site-weighted trace identity, by conjugation with the single intertwiner. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.weighted_trace_kz_eq_jimbo_of_intertwiner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.weighted_trace_kz_eq_jimbo_of_intertwiner","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L161-L167","doc":"`weighted_trace_kz_eq_jimbo` recovered by conjugation with the single intertwiner. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.weighted_trace_eq_of_intertwiner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.weighted_trace_eq_of_intertwiner","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L149-L159","doc":"**Weighted traces from the intertwiner.** If a weight-preserving unit `U` intertwines two\nmatrices, every weight-diagonal operator has the same weighted trace against both. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.kz_jimbo_intertwiner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.kz_jimbo_intertwiner","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L123-L147","doc":"**One weight-preserving intertwiner.** For every complex coupling `κ` with `q = e^{2πiκ}`\nnot a root of unity there is a single invertible `U` on `V^{⊗(m+1)}` that preserves every total\nweight space and satisfies `U · KZ(h) = Jimbo(h) · U` for all `h ∈ H_{m+1}(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_iff_commute_wproj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_iff_commute_wproj","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L110-L113","doc":"Weight-preservation is equivalent to commuting with every weight projector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.commute_diag_cnt_of_WP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.commute_diag_cnt_of_WP","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L100-L108","doc":"A weight-preserving matrix commutes with every weight-diagonal operator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_diag_cnt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_diag_cnt","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L95-L98","doc":"A weight-diagonal operator `diag(f(cnt a))` is weight-preserving. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm_intertwines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm_intertwines","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L83-L93","doc":"Blockwise intertwiners assemble to an intertwiner of weight-preserving matrices. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asmUnit_val","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asmUnit_val","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L78-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_asmUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_asmUnit","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L73-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asmUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asmUnit","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L66-L71","doc":"Units on the weight spaces assemble to a unit on `V^{⊗N}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm_one","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L60-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm_mul","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L55-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.res_asm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.res_asm","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L50-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_asm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.WP_asm","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L46-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.asm","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L42-L44","doc":"The block-diagonal matrix with block `B k` on the weight space `V_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.eq_of_res_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoIntertwiner.eq_of_res_eq","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoIntertwiner.lean#L33-L40","doc":"Two weight-preserving matrices with the same restriction to every weight space are equal. ","signatureChunk":0}]}